            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Nước",
            "review_text": "Chanh L\n9 contributions\n0\nANOTHER LEVEL OF VIETNAMESE RESTAURANT\nAug 2026 • Friends\nThis is a Vietnamese restaurant second to none. At the very first moment after walking inside the restaurant, you’ll be in awe with a unique high ceiling design. The set up is contemporary but still have a very strong Vietnamese spirit.\n\nThe food is authentic, tasteful, and of course, delicious!\n\nIf you’re looking for a truly Vietnamese cuisine restaurant for either a simple family dinner or an important business dinner, this is the place. \n\nHighly recommend.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nFishsauce-marinated fried chicken wings, deep fried springrolls, charcoal-grilled pork and apple snail patties, grilled beef ribs Phở taste\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 5, 2026",
